{
  "key": "gh-917",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "SM dead zone: red FIRST validation on a dev PR dispatches nothing",
    "description": "**Evidence (epam/dmtools-dart, 2026-10-16 11:06Z tick):** Machine SM concluded `processed: 0, skipped: 0` while TWO dev PRs sat with red first validations: #413 (quality 09:46Z — method_size 82/72-line test helpers) and #414 (quality 10:19Z — complexity CC=12 + method_size 94-line main). Log: ``\\═ OWNER DIRECTIVE (2026-10-15): a red pre-merge gate MUST arm a rework leg`` — but that rule matches only APPROVED PRs. A red first validation on a fresh dev PR matches NO rule → the trunk stalls until a human intervenes (hand-fixed 11:19Z, waves green after).\n\n**Ask:** extend the red-gate→rework rule to validation failures of ANY machine-authored PR (first validation included): red quality wave on an open dev PR → arm `agent:rework` on the issue carrier (or re-dispatch validation after the rework leg), with the same latch/anti-loop protections (max attempts, no infinite retry on unfixable-without-toolchain violations)."
  }
}

